stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loading: mount
    Loading --> All: parsed load succeeds
    Loading --> Unavailable: read refuses
    Unavailable --> Loading: refresh
    All --> NeedsReview: choose needs review
    NeedsReview --> Reviewed: choose reviewed
    Reviewed --> Reviewed: refresh with retained term hash preserves selection
    Reviewed --> All: new term hash reveals linked target
    Reviewed --> All: clear status
    NeedsReview --> Empty: refresh resolves last matching field
    Empty --> All: clear status
    All --> Locked: edit or save
    Locked --> Locked: refuse status change or uncertain receipt
    Locked --> Loading: confirmed receipt refreshes
    All --> Loading: refresh
    Loading --> Loading: ignore stale completion
    All --> Retired: authorization expires
    Retired --> Retired: ignore refresh
    Loading --> Disposed: dispose
    Locked --> Disposed: dispose
    Empty --> Disposed: dispose
    Disposed --> Disposed: ignore late completion
